(1,1,'BBCode help','[h2]Basic Formatting[/h2]\r\n[souptable]\r\n[table][tr][td]BBCode[/td]\r\n[td]Syntax[/td]\r\n[td]Example[/td]\r\n[/tr]\r\n[tr][td]Bold[br][br]Makes text bold.[/td]\r\n[td][inlinecode][b]ILOVEMOUSE[/b][/inlinecode]\r\n[/td]\r\n[td][b]ILOVEMOUSE[/b][/td]\r\n[/tr]\r\n[tr][td]Italics[br][br]Makes text italicized.[/td]\r\n[td][inlinecode][i]ILOVEMOUSE[/i][/inlinecode]\r\n[/td]\r\n[td][i]ILOVEMOUSE[/i][/td]\r\n[/tr]\r\n[tr][td]Underline[br][br]Underlines text.[/td]\r\n[td][inlinecode][u]ILOVEMOUSE[/u][/inlinecode]\r\n[/td]\r\n[td][u]ILOVEMOUSE[/u][/td]\r\n[/tr]\r\n[tr][td]Strikethrough[br][br]SWOONs text.[/td]\r\n[td][inlinecode][s]ILOVEMOUSE[/s][/inlinecode]\r\n[/td]\r\n[td][s]ILOVEMOUSE[/s][/td]\r\n[/tr]\r\n[tr][td]Sub/Superscript[br][br]Places text above or below a line.[/td]\r\n[td][inlinecode]I[sub]LOVE[/sub][sup]MOUSE[/sup][/inlinecode]\r\n[/td]\r\n[td]I[sub]LOVE[/sub][sup]MOUSE[/sup][/td]\r\n[/tr]\r\n[tr][td]Font[br][br]Changes the font.[/td]\r\n[td][inlinecode][font=Comic Sans MS]i love mouse? well yeah, how else could i move my cursor.[/font][/inlinecode]\r\n[/td]\r\n[td][font=Comic Sans MS]i love mouse? well yeah, how else could i move my cursor.[/font][/td]\r\n[/tr]\r\n[tr][td]Font Size[br][br]Changes the font size.[/td]\r\n[td][inlinecode][size=1]I[/size][size=4]LOVE[/size][size=7]MOUSE[/size][/inlinecode]\r\n[/td]\r\n[td][size=1]I[/size][size=4]LOVE[/size][size=7]MOUSE[/size][/td]\r\n[/tr]\r\n[tr][td]Font Color[br][br]Changes font color.[/td]\r\n[td][inlinecode][color=hotpink]I want to eat sand on the beach with you, mew~[/color][/inlinecode]\r\n[/td]\r\n[td][color=hotpink]I want to eat sand on the beach with you, mew~[/color][/td]\r\n[/tr]\r\n[/table]\r\n[/souptable]\r\n\r\n[h2]Media[/h2]\r\n[souptable]\r\n[table][tr][td]Link[br][br]Makes a hyperlink.[/td]\r\n[td][inlinecode][url=&quot;https://deltarune.com/&quot;]DELTARUNE[/url][/inlinecode]\r\n[/td]\r\n[td][url=&quot;https://deltarune.com/&quot;]DELTARUNE[/url][/td]\r\n[/tr]\r\n[tr][td]Youtube[br][br]Embeds a Youtube video.[/td]\r\n[td][inlinecode]\r\n[youtube]QbvvHsn6sgQ[/youtube]\r\n[/inlinecode]\r\n[/td]\r\n[td][youtube]QbvvHsn6sgQ[/youtube]\r\n[/td]\r\n[/tr]\r\n[tr][td]Image[br][br]Inserts an image.[/td]\r\n[td][inlinecode][img]https://deltaruneboards.net/avatars/characters/tenna.png[/img]\r\n[img height=300]https://deltaruneboards.net/avatars/characters/tenna.png[/img][/inlinecode]\r\n[/td]\r\n[td][img]https://deltaruneboards.net/avatars/characters/tenna.png[/img]\r\n[img height=300]https://deltaruneboards.net/avatars/characters/tenna.png[/img][/td]\r\n[/tr]\r\n[tr][td]Code[br][br]Inserts a codeblock (allows you to type BBCode without it formatting).[/td]\r\n[td][inlinecode]\r\n[code][b]ILOVEMOUSE[/b][/code]\r\n[/inlinecode][/td]\r\n[td][code][b]ILOVEMOUSE[/b][/code]\r\n[/td]\r\n[/tr]\r\n[tr][td]Quote[br][br]Quotes users. (Try to use the quote button on another&#39;s post whenever possible, it&#39;s much easier.)[/td]\r\n[td][inlinecode]\r\n[quote author=tobyfox]You&#39;re the Annoying now Dog![/quote]\r\n[/inlinecode][/td]\r\n[td][quote author=tobyfox]You&#39;re the Annoying now Dog![/quote]\r\n[/td]\r\n[/tr]\r\n[/table]\r\n[/souptable]\r\n\r\n[h2]Paragraph formatting[/h2]\r\n[souptable]\r\n[table][tr][td]Preformatted Text[br][br]changes the text???? i guess???[/td]\r\n[td]\r\n[inlinecode]\r\n[pre]\r\nI&#39;LL TELL YOU MY SCHEDULE. LISTEN CAREFULLY.\r\nON THURSDAY, I GO TO SELL THE DONUTS.\r\nON FRIDAY, I TOSS THE LEFTOVERS IN THE DUMPSTER.\r\nON SATURDAY, I LET IT COOL ON THE WINDOWSILL.\r\nON SUNDAY, I HARVEST THE WHEAT.\r\nHOLD YOUR BREATH, HEAD TO THE LEFT, AND COUNT BACKWARDS TO 100...\r\nDID YOU REMEMBER TO WRITE THAT DOWN?[/pre]\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n[/inlinecode]\r\n[/td]\r\n[td]\r\n[pre]\r\nI&#39;LL TELL YOU MY SCHEDULE. LISTEN CAREFULLY.\r\nON THURSDAY, I GO TO SELL THE DONUTS.\r\nON FRIDAY, I TOSS THE LEFTOVERS IN THE DUMPSTER.\r\nON SATURDAY, I LET IT COOL ON THE WINDOWSILL.\r\nON SUNDAY, I HARVEST THE WHEAT.\r\nHOLD YOUR BREATH, HEAD TO THE LEFT, AND COUNT BACKWARDS TO 100...\r\nDID YOU REMEMBER TO WRITE THAT DOWN?[/pre]\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n[/td]\r\n[/tr]\r\n[tr][td]Align Left[br][br]Aligns paragraphs to the left of the post. (Default)[/td]\r\n[td][inlinecode]\r\n[left]\r\nI&#39;LL TELL YOU MY SCHEDULE. LISTEN CAREFULLY.\r\nON THURSDAY, I GO TO SELL THE DONUTS.\r\nON FRIDAY, I TOSS THE LEFTOVERS IN THE DUMPSTER.\r\nON SATURDAY, I LET IT COOL ON THE WINDOWSILL.\r\nON SUNDAY, I HARVEST THE WHEAT.\r\nHOLD YOUR BREATH, HEAD TO THE LEFT, AND COUNT BACKWARDS TO 100...\r\nDID YOU REMEMBER TO WRITE THAT DOWN?\r\n[/left]\r\n[/inlinecode]\r\n[/td]\r\n[td][left]\r\nI&#39;LL TELL YOU MY SCHEDULE. LISTEN CAREFULLY.\r\nON THURSDAY, I GO TO SELL THE DONUTS.\r\nON FRIDAY, I TOSS THE LEFTOVERS IN THE DUMPSTER.\r\nON SATURDAY, I LET IT COOL ON THE WINDOWSILL.\r\nON SUNDAY, I HARVEST THE WHEAT.\r\nHOLD YOUR BREATH, HEAD TO THE LEFT, AND COUNT BACKWARDS TO 100...\r\nDID YOU REMEMBER TO WRITE THAT DOWN?\r\n[/left]\r\n[/td]\r\n[/tr]\r\n[tr][td]Align Center[br][br]Aligns paragraphs to the center of the post.[/td]\r\n[td][inlinecode]\r\n[center]\r\nI&#39;LL TELL YOU MY SCHEDULE. LISTEN CAREFULLY.\r\nON THURSDAY, I GO TO SELL THE DONUTS.\r\nON FRIDAY, I TOSS THE LEFTOVERS IN THE DUMPSTER.\r\nON SATURDAY, I LET IT COOL ON THE WINDOWSILL.\r\nON SUNDAY, I HARVEST THE WHEAT.\r\nHOLD YOUR BREATH, HEAD TO THE LEFT, AND COUNT BACKWARDS TO 100...\r\nDID YOU REMEMBER TO WRITE THAT DOWN?\r\n[/center]\r\n[/inlinecode]\r\n[/td]\r\n[td]\r\n[center]\r\nI&#39;LL TELL YOU MY SCHEDULE. LISTEN CAREFULLY.\r\nON THURSDAY, I GO TO SELL THE DONUTS.\r\nON FRIDAY, I TOSS THE LEFTOVERS IN THE DUMPSTER.\r\nON SATURDAY, I LET IT COOL ON THE WINDOWSILL.\r\nON SUNDAY, I HARVEST THE WHEAT.\r\nHOLD YOUR BREATH, HEAD TO THE LEFT, AND COUNT BACKWARDS TO 100...\r\nDID YOU REMEMBER TO WRITE THAT DOWN?\r\n[/center]\r\n[/td]\r\n[/tr]\r\n[tr][td]Align Right[br][br]Aligns paragraphs to the right of the post.[/td]\r\n[td][inlinecode]\r\n[right]\r\nI&#39;LL TELL YOU MY SCHEDULE. LISTEN CAREFULLY.\r\nON THURSDAY, I GO TO SELL THE DONUTS.\r\nON FRIDAY, I TOSS THE LEFTOVERS IN THE DUMPSTER.\r\nON SATURDAY, I LET IT COOL ON THE WINDOWSILL.\r\nON SUNDAY, I HARVEST THE WHEAT.\r\nHOLD YOUR BREATH, HEAD TO THE LEFT, AND COUNT BACKWARDS TO 100...\r\nDID YOU REMEMBER TO WRITE THAT DOWN?\r\n[/right]\r\n[/inlinecode]\r\n[/td]\r\n[td]\r\n[right]\r\nI&#39;LL TELL YOU MY SCHEDULE. LISTEN CAREFULLY.\r\nON THURSDAY, I GO TO SELL THE DONUTS.\r\nON FRIDAY, I TOSS THE LEFTOVERS IN THE DUMPSTER.\r\nON SATURDAY, I LET IT COOL ON THE WINDOWSILL.\r\nON SUNDAY, I HARVEST THE WHEAT.\r\nHOLD YOUR BREATH, HEAD TO THE LEFT, AND COUNT BACKWARDS TO 100...\r\nDID YOU REMEMBER TO WRITE THAT DOWN?\r\n[/right]\r\n[/td]\r\n[/tr]\r\n[tr][td]Justify Alignment[br][br]Aligns paragraphs to take up both sides of the post.[/td]\r\n[td]\r\n[inlinecode]\r\n[justify]\r\nIF YOU WILL IT, WE SHALL MEET AGAIN AT THAT PLACE...\r\n[/justify]\r\n[/inlinecode]\r\n(shortened because it&#39;s all in one line (extremely long))\r\n[/td]\r\n[td]\r\n[justify]\r\nIF YOU WILL IT, WE SHALL MEET AGAIN AT THAT PLACE... WHETHER 11 HOURS OR 11 YEARS, DELTARUNE WILL BE WAITING. SO TAKE YOUR TIME, WASH YOUR FACE, AND GET DRESSED!\r\n[/justify]\r\n[/td]\r\n[/tr]\r\n[tr][td]Float Left[br][br]Floats content to the left.[/td]\r\n[td][inlinecode]\r\n[float=left max=45%][img]https://deltaruneboards.net/avatars/characters/tenna.png[/img][/float]\r\nIF ONLY HE HADN&#39;T ABANDONED ME.\r\nMY OLD PARTNER...\r\nI WAS GONNA PUT HIM ON TV! MAKE HIM A STAR!\r\nI GAVE HIM EVERYTHING! EVERYTHING I HAD! MY LIFE ADVICE!\r\n[/inlinecode]\r\n[/td]\r\n[td]\r\n[float=left max=45%][img]https://deltaruneboards.net/avatars/characters/tenna.png[/img][/float]\r\nIF ONLY HE HADN&#39;T ABANDONED ME.\r\nMY OLD PARTNER...\r\nI WAS GONNA PUT HIM ON TV! MAKE HIM A STAR!\r\nI GAVE HIM EVERYTHING! EVERYTHING I HAD! MY LIFE ADVICE!\r\nALL. HE HAD. TO DO. WAS TELL ME WHAT HIS LITTLE SECRET WAS.\r\nHIS SECRET TO BEING A BIG SHOT...\r\nIT TOOK A LITTLE SWEET TALK...\r\nBUT JUST WHEN I HAD, FINALLY, FINALLY ? HA HA --\r\nGOTTEN HIM TO SIGN THE DEAL.\r\n[/td]\r\n[/tr]\r\n[tr][td]Float Right[br][br]Floats content to the right.[/td]\r\n[td][inlinecode]\r\n[float=right max=45%][img]https://deltaruneboards.net/avatars/characters/tenna.png[/img][/float]\r\nIF ONLY HE HADN&#39;T ABANDONED ME.\r\nMY OLD PARTNER...\r\nI WAS GONNA PUT HIM ON TV! MAKE HIM A STAR!\r\nI GAVE HIM EVERYTHING! EVERYTHING I HAD! MY LIFE ADVICE!\r\n[/inlinecode]\r\n[/td]\r\n[td]\r\n[float=right max=45%][img]https://deltaruneboards.net/avatars/characters/tenna.png[/img][/float]\r\nIF ONLY HE HADN&#39;T ABANDONED ME.\r\nMY OLD PARTNER...\r\nI WAS GONNA PUT HIM ON TV! MAKE HIM A STAR!\r\nI GAVE HIM EVERYTHING! EVERYTHING I HAD! MY LIFE ADVICE!\r\nALL. HE HAD. TO DO. WAS TELL ME WHAT HIS LITTLE SECRET WAS.\r\nHIS SECRET TO BEING A BIG SHOT...\r\nIT TOOK A LITTLE SWEET TALK...\r\nBUT JUST WHEN I HAD, FINALLY, FINALLY ? HA HA --\r\nGOTTEN HIM TO SIGN THE DEAL.\r\n[/td]\r\n[/tr]\r\n[/table]\r\n[/souptable]',1788920896,344),
(3,1,'Credits','The [color=cyan]DELTARUNE Unofficial Message Boards[/color] are a fan-made website, and do not have or claim to have any affiliation to Toby Fox or the DELTARUNE/UNDERTALE development teams. (That&#39;s why we have &quot;Unofficial&quot; in the name!)\r\n\r\nThis forum makes use of game assets from DELTARUNE/UNDERTALE (namely sprites), as well as assets created for or allowed for use on the forum.\r\n\r\n[center][size=6][font=Determination Mono]Smilies[/font][/size][/center]\r\nThe smilies below were created for the DELTARUNE Unofficial Message Boards. They may be used off-site with attribution.\r\n\r\n[souptable]\r\n[columns]\r\n[member=34]FloweryScarf[/member] [nextcol] :aqua: :aquaConfused: :aquaEye: :aquaGiggle: :aquaWave: :berdly: :berdlyDepressed: :berdlyNervous: :berdlyShock: :berdlySmug: :blue: :blueSideEye: :blueSwoon: :flowery: :floweryBishie: :floweryBlush: :floweryFlip: :floweryPeace: :floweryXD: :green: :greenShrug: :hackerThink: :hathyCute: :IMAGE_CHILL: :IMAGE_FRIEND: :IMAGE_HATER: :jigsawry: :jigsHappy: :jigSowwy: :knight: :knightCry: :knightLaugh: :knightRoar: :kris: :krisBlush: :krisEvilEye: :krisPeace: :lancer: :mrButterfly: :mrButterflyAngry: :mrButterflyHappy: :noelle: :noelleBlush: :noelleQuestion: :noelleShock: :noelleWhat: :noelleX3: :old: :oldman: :orange: :orangeAngry: :orangeApprove: :orangeBleh: :orangeBrave: :orangeCry: :orangeDisapprove: :pink: :pinkLaugh: :pinkMad: :pinkPeace: :pinkShock: :pinkSweatdrop: :pippinsConcern: :pippinsCool: :pippinsWink: :queenLMAO: :queenSurprise: :queenTrue: :ralsei: :ralseiAngry: :ralseiGrim: :ralseiHappy: :ralseiOkay: :ralseiSad: :ralseiUnimpressed: :rudinnSleepy: :rudinnSparkle: :seth: :sethAnguish: :sethDrool: :sethExasperated: :sethGlasses: :susie: :susieHappy: :susieIrate: :susiePolite: :susieSurprise: :susieSus: :tenna: :tennaFlower: :tennaGlooby: :tennaNormal: :virovirokun: :viroviroSick: :yellow: :yellowCry: :yellowGun: :yellowShock:\r\n[nextrow]\r\n[member=259]34521509436720948and2[/member] [nextcol] :hateWins: :loveWins:\r\n[nextrow]\r\nWerewerewire [nextcol] :werewerewireMigrane:\r\n[nextrow]\r\n[member=59]seavil[/member] [nextcol] :lancerSquish: :queenEvil:\r\n[nextrow]\r\n[member=61]PUPPET[/member] [nextcol] :spamton: :spamtonApprove: :spamtonPlease: :spamtonIsForMe: :spamtonKissy:\r\n[nextrow]\r\n[member=103]ViveeFox[/member] [nextcol] :annoyingYummy:\r\n[nextrow]\r\n[member=41]Paradise, Paradise[/member] [nextcol] :berdlyRose: :jigShock: :oldmanThink: :queenJoy:\r\n[nextrow]\r\n[member=267]ralsusie[/member] [nextcol] :ralseiPleading:\r\n[nextrow]\r\n[member=25]elf-hollow[/member] [nextcol] :krisApprove: :rouxlsWinketh: :rouxlsSayeth: :rouxlsLaugh: :spamtonStatic: :tennaBindle:\r\n[nextrow]\r\n[member=56]HEROs_SWORD[/member] [nextcol] :tennaSalute:\r\n[/columns]\r\n[/souptable]\r\n\r\n\r\n[center][size=6][font=Determination Mono]Badges[/font][/size][/center]\r\n[souptable]\r\n[columns]\r\ndecamarks [nextcol] ENEMY_MANAGER, ENEMY_SPAWN, NPC_ADVERT\r\n[nextrow]\r\n[member=34]FloweryScarf[/member] [nextcol] HERO_RING, HERO_????, ENEMY_CANDLE, ENEMY_HALBERD, ENEMY_HOLYWATER, ENEMY_JOKER, ENEMY_MIC, ENEMY_MICROPHONE, ENEMY_MIKE, ENEMY_MOUSE, ENEMY_REMOTE, NPC_CASSETTE, NPC_CD, NPC_EMAIL, NPC_PALETTE, NPC_SPEAKER, NPC_STUFFEDTOY, NPC_POWERSTRIP\r\n[nextrow]\r\n[member=274]penumbraPhantism[/member] [nextcol] BOSS_COMPUTER*, BOSS_KNIGHT*, BOSS_SPADE*, ENEMY_ANTIVIRUS*, ENEMY_BLOCKS, ENEMY_CAMERA*, ENEMY_CHECKER*, ENEMY_COLOR*, ENEMY_COOLWATER*, ENEMY_CROWNED*, ENEMY_DIAMONDX*, ENEMY_DIRT, ENEMY_DUST*, ENEMY_HEART*, ENEMY_HEARTX*, ENEMY_JIGSAW*, ENEMY_PAWN*, ENEMY_POPUP*, ENEMY_VIRUS*, ENEMY_WIRE*, ENEMY_WIRELESS*, NPC_HAMMER*, NPC_OUTLET*, NPC_TRAFFIC*\r\n[nextrow]\r\n[member=59]seavil[/member] [nextcol] ENEMY_BELL*, ENEMY_INCENSE*, ENEMY_QUILL*, NPC_HALLOWEEN*, NPC_METRONOME*, NPC_CUP*, NPC_ORGAN, NPC_WAFER\r\n[nextrow]\r\n[url=&quot;https://www.spriters-resource.com/custom_edited/deltarunecustoms/asset/475419/&quot;]Burger Gaming (Spriters Resource)[/url] [nextcol] NPC_STAR, ENEMY_STAR\r\n[/columns]\r\n[/souptable]\r\n[i]Sprites edited by site administration are denoted with an asterisk.[/i]\r\n\r\n\r\n[center][size=6][font=Determination Mono]Banners[/font][/size][/center]\r\n[center]\r\n[souptable]\r\n[columns]\r\n[img]https://deltaruneboards.net/assets/banners/Beheeyemite.png[/img]\r\n\r\n[member=134]SNEO[/member] \r\n[/columns]\r\n[/souptable]\r\n[/center]\r\n\r\n\r\n[center][size=6][font=Determination Mono]Interface assets[/font][/size][/center]\r\nThe following contributors helped create assets for the forum theme.\r\n[souptable]\r\n[columns]\r\n[member=61]PUPPET[/member] [nextcol] BBCode editor icons\r\n[nextrow]\r\n[member=48]bloxy97[/member] [nextcol] [url=&quot;https://github.com/deltaruneboards/forum/pull/12&quot;]Board icons[/url]\r\n[/columns]\r\n[/souptable]\r\n\r\n\r\n[center][size=6][font=Determination Mono]Theme[/font][/size][/center]\r\nThe following contributors helped with frontend and theme development.\r\n[souptable]\r\n[columns]\r\n[url=&quot;https://web.archive.org/web/20070227004747/http://www.kskins.nbsdesignz.com/invisionfree.html&quot;]Kman of Kskins[/url] [nextcol] Base for the original DELTARUNE Unofficial Message Boards theme\r\n[nextrow]\r\ndecamarks [nextcol] Original DELTARUNE Unofficial Message Boards theme\r\n[nextrow]\r\n[url=&quot;https://deltaruneboards.net/index.php?action=credits&quot;]SMF contributors[/url] [nextcol] SMF default theme, used as a base for the current theme\r\n[nextrow]\r\n[member=2]Antquinox[/member] [nextcol] Reworking the SMF default theme to be closer to the original theme\r\n[nextrow]\r\n[member=34]FloweryScarf[/member] [nextcol] Various theme adjustments\r\n[nextrow]\r\n[member=84]333[/member] [nextcol] Light mode and various theme adjustments\r\n[nextrow]\r\n[member=32]crushpunchh[/member] [nextcol] Various theme adjustments\r\n[nextrow]\r\n[member=1]KockaAdmiralac[/member] [nextcol] Various theme adjustments\r\n[/columns]\r\n[/souptable]\r\n\r\n\r\n[center][size=6][font=Determination Mono]Backend[/font][/size][/center]\r\n[souptable]\r\n[columns]\r\n[url=&quot;https://deltaruneboards.net/index.php?action=credits&quot;]SMF contributors[/url] [nextcol] Simple Machines Forum, used as a base for this forum\r\n[nextrow]\r\n[member=2]Antquinox[/member] [nextcol] Forum management and adjustments\r\n[nextrow]\r\n[member=1]KockaAdmiralac[/member] [nextcol] Forum management, adjustments, profile comments\r\n[nextrow]\r\n[member=13]mycringefactory[/member] [nextcol] Implementing [url=&quot;https://github.com/deltaruneboards/forum/pull/14&quot;]thread tags[/url], [url=&quot;https://github.com/deltaruneboards/forum/pull/18&quot;]user statuses[/url], and improvements around ignoring [url=&quot;https://github.com/deltaruneboards/forum/pull/20&quot;]search results[/url] and [url=&quot;https://github.com/deltaruneboards/forum/pull/21&quot;]topics[/url]\r\n[nextrow]\r\n[member=23]checkmaster[/member] [nextcol] Username system changes, hiding unnecessary personal data elements\r\n[nextrow]\r\n[member=30]candycanearter07[/member] [nextcol] Shop system modules, custom titles, badges\r\n[/columns]\r\n[/souptable]',1788922019,193),
